==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|skīnan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*skīnaną}}. Cognate with Low German {{term|schienen|lang=nds}}, Dutch {{term|schijnen|lang=nl}}, English {{term|shine|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|skinne|lang=da}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃaɪnən/|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|schei|nen|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-scheinen.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-scheinen.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

